  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hine ðonne seo mægð forlæte ⁊ him foregyldan nellen, ðonne wille ic þæt eal seo mægð sy unfah, butan ðam hand[d]ædan, gif hy him syððan ne doð mete ne munde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, his kindred abandon him and will not pay compensation on his behalf, it is my will that, if afterwards they give him neither food nor shelter, all of the kindred, except the delinquent, shall be free from vendetta.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hine þonne seo mægð forlete, ⁊ him foregyldan nellen, ðonne wille ic, ðæt eall seo mægð sy unfah, butan ðam handdædan, gif hy him syððan ne doð mete ne munde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
